### TechMonkeys API Test Requests
### For VS Code REST Client Extension
### 
### INSTRUCTIONS:
### 1. Klikni "Send Request" iznad svakog requesta (ili Ctrl+Alt+R / Cmd+Alt+R)
### 2. Za login, kopiraj token iz response-a i zameni @token vrednost ispod
### 3. Sada možeš testirati sve zaštićene endpoint-e
###
### Base URL - adjust for your environment
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE_AFTER_LOGIN

### Test Variables
@username = testuser
@password = testpass123
@name = Test User

###
### AUTH ENDPOINTS
###

### Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login - Get token
# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Nakon što pokreneš ovaj request, kopiraj "token" iz response-a
# i zameni "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE_AFTER_LOGIN" u @token varijabli na vrhu fajla
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Get current user (requires token)
# ⚠️ Prvo pokreni login request iznad, kopiraj token i zameni @token varijablu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (requires token)
# ⚠️ Logout endpoint - removes token on client side
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### USER ENDPOINTS
###

### Get all users (requires token)
# ⚠️ Zahteva validan token - prvo se uloguj
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete user (requires token)
# Replace :id with actual user ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### CHAT ENDPOINTS (if available)
###

### Get chat history (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prepare first step (chat with AI - requires token)
# ⚠️ Zahteva validan token - prvo se uloguj
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/prepareFirstStep
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

